[00:08.00]Distant witch laughter "हीहीहीही...", owl hooting, dholak builds slowly.
[00:10.77]Whispered female vocals, each closer:
[00:13.53]पिंकी...
[00:16.30]पिंकी...
[00:19.07]पिंकी..." (right ear, suddenly loud) "हु!
[00:21.84]Dhol blast. Thunder strike. Bass drop.
[00:24.60]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
