[01:00.58]Loud laughter: "हाहाहाहाहा...
[01:03.35]Echo: "र पिंकी... नाच......
[01:06.12]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[01:08.88]Tempo slows. Male backing vocal cries softly in background. Ominous dholak.
