[02:18.07]Witch's sexy laugh: "हीहीहीही...
[02:20.84]Disco lights flicker... stop... one light remains.
[02:23.61]Footsteps dance in darkness - but stage is empty.
[02:26.37]Payal bells pan left to right.
[02:29.14]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[02:31.91]Flowing, melodic but deeply unsettling. Romance turning cold.
